  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A forest plot of the proportion (%) of participants with headache after C-Tb in six studies, ranging from 3.8% (Aggerbeck 2013) to 17.2% (Aggerbeck 2019). The random-effects pooled proportion is 11.3% (7.8–16.0) across 2723 participants, with high heterogeneity (I² = 79%).",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "مخطط شجري لنسبة (%) المشاركين الذين أصيبوا بالصداع بعد اختبار C-Tb في ست دراسات، تتراوح بين 3.8% (Aggerbeck 2013) و17.2% (Aggerbeck 2019). وتبلغ النسبة المجمّعة بنموذج التأثيرات العشوائية 11.3% (7.8–16.0) لدى 2723 مشاركاً، مع عدم تجانس مرتفع (I² = 79%).",
      "lang": "ar",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
        "session": "https://claude.ai/code/session_01Qmmkt7LJVddPRBy6F6BnEb"
      },
      "drafted_at": "2026-11-11"
    },
    {
      "text": "森林图显示六项研究中C-Tb后出现头痛的参与者比例（%），范围为3.8%（Aggerbeck 2013）至17.2%（Aggerbeck 2019）。2723名参与者的随机效应合并比例为11.3%（7.8–16.0），异质性高（I² = 79%）。",
      "lang": "zh",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
        "kind": "agent",
        "id": "claude-code",
        "model": "not-disclosed",
